SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Fisheries of the Northeastern United States\;
  Summer Flounder Fishery\; Quota Transfer From North Carolina to Massachus
 etts
DESCRIPTION:NMFS announces that the State of North Carolina is transferrin
 g a portion of its 2026 commercial summer flounder quota to the Commonweal
 th of Massachusetts. This adjustment to the 2026 fishing year quota is nec
 essary to comply with the Summer Flounder\, Scup\, and Black Sea Bass Fish
 ery Management Plan (FMP) quota transfer provisions. This announcement inf
 orms the public of the revised 2026 commercial quotas for North Carolina a
