 isers and Funds Can Custody Crypto Assets Under the Federal Securities Law
 s
DESCRIPTION:The Securities and Exchange Commission today proposed new rule
 s and amendments to provide a tailored framework for the custody of crypto
  assets for registered investment advisers and regulated funds\, i.e. regi
 stered investment companies and business…\nhttps://www.sec.gov/newsroom/
 press-releases/2026-100-sec-proposal-would-address-how-investment-advisers
